{"version":1,"content":"<p>新婚夫婦楊明與莊思明今天（29日）出席《夫妻肺片2》開鏡拜神儀式，夫婦喜歡小孩，他們在生育方面順其自然，節目中向在場「多仔公」林盛斌和婦產科醫生取經，目標生2個，楊明希望擁有一仔一女，笑言已預視自己做慈父嬌縱女兒。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:41:30.517154+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:55:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:40:13.865164+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:19.599024+00:00","content_hash":"63a951fc2621c4c0ecc1d99bb64b185d15eab99bfb7c99588b794edbd0f9d987","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}